  description: Distribute a number of Cubic Counters on face-up monsters your opponent
    controls, up to the number of "Cubic" monsters you control. (Monsters with a
    Cubic Counter cannot attack, also negate their effects.) You can banish this
    card from your GY, then target 1 "Cubic" monster you control; this turn, each
    time it destroys a monster by battle that has a Cubic Counter, inflict damage
    to your opponent equal to the original ATK of that destroyed monster. You can
    only use each effect of "Cubic Causality" once per turn.
